  "title": "Soft Molasses Cookies IV",
  "description": "This is my mothers molasses cookie recipe.. They are very good. A very old fashioned recipe, no one will ever guess the secret ingredient. For a fun variation, substitute maraschino cherries for the raisins.",
  "authors": [
